  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: CPU denial-of-service in html.parser.HTMLParser via\n     repeated unterminated markup declarations\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-15308.patch: accumulate incrementally fed\n       data in a list and only join and rescan it once a growing threshold\n       is reached, so an unterminated construct (tag, comment, PI, doctype,\n       CDATA, RAWTEXT element) spread across many feed() calls no longer\n       makes both the buffer concatenation and the rescan quadratic in the\n       input size (backport of upstream commit bcf98ddbc40e, gh-153030 /\n       GH-153031).\n     - CVE-2026-15308",
